# backslash-text-crlf: Does a CRLF file behave like an LF file for text after a backslash (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: v@3=3
# pc: ODE0075
# ruling: the carriage return ends the dropped text like a line feed; the next line is joined (language.md, Lines).
x'=1+\5
2
x(0)=0
aux v=x
@ total=1,dt=0.5,meth=euler
